This product includes a Rust implementation of the classic Porter stemmer
derived from Apache OpenNLP, Copyright The Apache Software Foundation,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Apache OpenNLP includes a Java adaptation of Martin Porter's Release 3
stemming algorithm.

The `leann-graph` vector provider (src/leann_graph.rs) is an independent
Rust implementation of the high-degree preserving graph pruning and
two-level selective-recomputation search described in "LEANN: A
Low-Storage Vector Index" (Wang et al., arXiv:2506.08276). No LEANN source
code is included. The LEANN reference implementation
(https://github.com/StarTrail-org/LEANN) is distributed under the MIT
License, Copyright (c) 2025 LEANN Contributors.
